<view class="page"><view class="topbar"><view class="brand"><view class="brand-mark">上</view><text>制作工作台</text></view><view class="capsule">原图保真</view></view><view class="stepper"><view class="step active"><view class="step-dot">1</view><text>上传商品</text></view><view class="step"><view class="step-dot">2</view><text>选择模板</text></view><view class="step"><view class="step-dot">3</view><text>制作图片</text></view></view><view class="notice tip">💡 拍摄小建议：商品完整入镜，在自然柔和光线下拍摄，排版效果更清晰。</view><view class="card upload-card"><view class="card-heading"><view><view class="section-title">商品原图</view><view class="muted">支持 PNG / JPEG，最大 5MB</view></view><view wx:if="{{imagePath}}" class="success-tag">✓ 已选择</view></view><view class="uploader {{imagePath ? 'has-image' : ''}}" bindtap="chooseImage"><image wx:if="{{imagePath}}" src="{{imagePath}}" mode="aspectFit"/><view wx:else class="empty-upload"><view class="plus">＋</view><view class="upload-title">拍一张或从相册选择</view><view class="muted">商品完整、背景干净、画面清晰</view></view><view wx:if="{{imagePath}}" class="replace">↻ 更换原图</view></view></view><view class="field-card"><text class="label">商品名称 <text class="required">*</text></text><input class="input" maxlength="30" placeholder="例如：手作粗陶咖啡杯" value="{{name}}" bindinput="onName"/><view class="counter">{{name.length}} / 30</view></view><view class="field-card"><text class="label">展示价格 <text class="optional">选填</text></text><view class="price-field"><text>¥</text><input class="input" type="digit" placeholder="89.00" value="{{price}}" bindinput="onPrice"/></view></view><view class="field-card"><text class="label">促销按钮文案 <text class="optional">选填，最多 12 字</text></text><input class="input" maxlength="12" placeholder="例如：立即抢购 / 私信下单" value="{{promotionText}}" bindinput="onPromotion"/><view class="counter">{{promotionText.length}} / 12</view></view><view class="field-card"><text class="label">品牌标识 <text class="optional">选填，最多 12 字</text></text><input class="input" maxlength="12" placeholder="例如：小满手作" value="{{brandName}}" bindinput="onBrandName"/><view class="brand-colors"><view wx:for="{{brandColors}}" wx:key="*this" class="brand-color {{brandColor === item ? 'active' : ''}}" style="background:{{item}}" data-color="{{item}}" bindtap="selectBrandColor">{{brandColor === item ? '✓' : ''}}</view></view></view><view class="field-card"><text class="label">商品卖点 <text class="optional">最多 3 条</text></text><view class="feature-input"><input class="input" maxlength="20" placeholder="例如：手工拉坯" value="{{featureText}}" bindinput="onFeature"/><button bindtap="addFeature">添加</button></view><view class="chips"><view class="chip active" wx:for="{{features}}" wx:key="index" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="removeFeature">{{item}} ×</view></view><view class="muted helper">点击已添加卖点可删除</view></view><view class="bottom-action"><button class="primary" bindtap="next">下一步，选择模板 →</button></view></view>
